## Part 9 — Rollout

**Day 0.** Auto-approve the retrieval and build commands. Confirm Ubuntu. Move credentials into the secret store.

**Week 1.** Baseline Arm A untouched. In parallel, build and verify the blueprint — blueprint work is free and cannot contaminate the measurement.

**Week 2.** Ship the hardened AGENTS.md and the first playbook. Run Arm B.

**Week 3.** Wire pre-flight context injection into your prompt generator: run the retrieval queries on your own infrastructure and paste results into the CONTEXT block. Measure separately so you can attribute it.

**Week 4.** Enable Devin Review with Auto-Fix. Audit Knowledge for misleading items — a single stale item taxes every session org-wide, invisibly. Publish the ACU-per-merged-PR panel.

**Then ratchet.** Weekly: take the three highest-ACU sessions, read Session Insights, push each finding into the blueprint, the AGENTS.md, or the playbook. Nothing gets fixed twice in a prompt. Any environment issue appearing twice in Action Items becomes a blueprint defect ticket.

